    "description": "Input — the field box, and only the box. The root is a WRAPPER (an <input> cannot contain children — icons live inside the field), with the native control reset flat inside; states read through it via :has(). THE CLASSIC EDS FIELD (the EDS 1.0 identity, restored v0.6.0 from mock 345:1023): bg-input fill, square corners, and a thin bottom border that carries the states — border-neutral-medium at rest. xs-STRETCHED inset (a field is a stretched box; converges vertically with md-squished while the horizontal inset drops to xs — the field hugs its text). Height is never stated: inset × 2 + cap(value) resolves to 24 / 36 / 44. The assembled field is a COMPOSITION — see compositions/text-field.json.\n\nGenerated from eds.input v0.7.0 — edit the contract, not this component.",
